// The HRESULTs the IXnRemote methods return ([MS-CMPO] 3.4.4, [MS-DTYP] 2.2.18) are not
// declared here. The whole of [MS-ERREF] 2.1.1 lives in
// github.com/TheManticoreProject/Manticore/windows/errors/hresult as the HRESULT type,
// and the four values repeated here covered four of that 2928-value table while drifting
// from it — [MS-CMPO] enumerates no closed set of failures, so a partner may surface any
// of them. Convert a returned status with hresult.HRESULT(status) and compare against
// hresult.S_OK; hresult.HRESULT.IsSuccess covers the whole success range, since for an
// HRESULT success is a severity bit rather than the single value zero.

